Armijo and weak-Wolfe comparisons, including their strict signs, agree.
     This is a covariance calculation, not an existence theorem for a local
trajectory. To transfer a particular run, the local model must cover the current
point and every candidate the search actually visits. Under that containment,
induction on the bracket decisions transfers the full trial tree, and induction on
accepted steps transfers the matrices. We verify that containment separately
in each construction below.
